PRIVACY POLICY

Last updated:8-6-2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Patrick Bloem ("we", "our", "us") collects, uses, and protects your information when you use the mobile application "Serpentium" ("App").

By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.

