1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
------------------------------------------------------------

We may collect the following types of information:

1.1 User-Provided Data
You may enter and store data within the App, including:
- Animal records (e.g. snakes)
- Genetic data and morph information
- Breeding records and pairings
- Notes and custom data

This data is stored locally on your device unless otherwise specified.

------------------------------------------------------------
1.2 Device Information
We may automatically collect limited technical information such as:
- Device type
- Operating system version
- App version

This is used to improve app performance and stability.

------------------------------------------------------------
1.3 Purchase Information
If you use in-app purchases:
- Transactions are processed by Google Play or similar providers
- We do not have direct access to your payment details

------------------------------------------------------------
